{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:de35133b50209a66dc6035784ad18121b4d70e120ebc21881c2849e4e1cf958b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83390e59a842e3fcc2b2d1803d1c877890c58c84b89f6b5526d152746e057450",
      "text": "活下去的资格",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75421a0e2325b16a3d20e943213ff4dfd824eda39dabdfd5817accab573ab2d1",
      "text": "百百人为了迎战全一模考而努力用功。\n房间里虽然摆满了各式各样的奖状与奖杯，\n却没有父母所期待的“第1名”，让他把自己逼入了绝境。\n不久后，模考的成绩出来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83390e59a842e3fcc2b2d1803d1c877890c58c84b89f6b5526d152746e057450",
      "text": "活下去的资格",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7ea783b4786b1f89d5de9d40ba80cd399bfc740d1d66622ad26929b4f48d19",
      "text": "百百人的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df4fd807a200438531b835eff12eec0888a18dc494a1340a64692f160cfa4e63",
      "text": "嗯，复习到这里，期中考应该没问题了吧。\n接下来是全一模考的范围……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a848491496effd0545758b079d8fd25a72bdc7fd2dbff9673b3f2dcfdb8ef8bb",
      "text": "……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d4ef395d7e249cfdd2c68b51ebc8866906512ef52756f1aec6fbd4952ea660f",
      "text": "（刚才，头晕了一下）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3f87163db457e3f82b1858bba1032d3440244f8b3d043455c144624823803f",
      "text": "也是呢，不知不觉都已经过了零点了。\n这样下去，去学校大概又要迟到了吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ebe7e3ca162f0c08a10b831685ff7e3270573dcff3783be8411a6096aa29e2c",
      "text": "（即便如此，还是先把模考的复习做完吧。\n因为，这次一定要赶上才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e19442183370fcd44d679ef68e85627dfd3cc55605765d691e863c8d892c5922",
      "text": "（必须赶上……\n爸爸和妈妈期望的模样才行……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a4a7d10733ad542628fb72d44c33bbdda35ccde9ac6a3e594795c43baaa634",
      "text": "……我必须拿到第一名才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf7859283c68795596e202221797744bca025488fec185d54d577de823a9018c",
      "text": "不是这种半吊子的奖项，\n或是奖杯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a5937cb486d8aec19b5b3ab06c6e03402d0ec0d216b80e902a7b263d91bb49f",
      "text": "（话说回来，不知不觉多了好多啊。\n我记得，放在这里的是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edac67ba999577e658fa8e8c4622a09a44c35c998e90f5cfc1d83ce8fb7edfb3",
      "text": "（对，是小学写读后感拿到的奖状。\n然后，是游泳的奖杯……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792844b9b9f643f464f572620eaa52d646e6acb83c2f9180acbd3b9c0889454d",
      "text": "（每一个都只是第二名或者第三名。\n不对，甚至还有比这更低的。）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d07039ed97551185b9b47fe8ab7cf24394bc59d04147090fbe5da94c5067e0e",
      "text": "（就连最让我入迷的画画，\n也没拿到过什么了不起的奖项）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8252e9b46917fcdc6508baf5b256bf0963326188cb91a6bc7972c543f807fd09",
      "text": "（到头来，也就只是“喜欢”而已，\n我根本没有任何特别的才能……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40b0cf0180dc99b4451df4c5afb2194583ccdbc9edd43addddf6a687dfc53c87",
      "text": "啊……\n这个，在东京都内拿到了第一名呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88924699a06073aeae4a7307e7284002e3cf36ce0d9beb345487347a3bc440ef",
      "text": "（可是，在那之后妈妈对我说\n“我们要向更高的目标前进哦”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7c12f607cbea127b294fc5def3346980d3f34a00467352e20c33bb6e08490ca",
      "text": "（结果一挑战全国赛，名次就一口气\n掉下去了……让他们失望了来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:644110f36f8311f8dd3cef96a9e2f2ff9284c2e7c353fd46ff564df2171a70e6",
      "text": "……“这孩子，到底能做好什么呢？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee7456c8549d73b12a2892a0f76907fcc4926a2295492e69bdacdf808d005396",
      "text": "“下次至少在学习上拿个第一名看看吧”……是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f542ee99e3d623fb2e2b80e5ddfe198463c71f674f158e0375a63e42bef184d2",
      "text": "……我也想早点知道啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e20d5e480c54434f3b0b1a962f3ab22cd2a8d9a900005919c99a88881beb79a",
      "text": "像爸爸和妈妈说的那样，\n我到底能把什么事情做好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e09c6364bc8cfb1eafd198c9cfb2798179794104ae27f824d2da5a5ebd3ac6",
      "text": "果然对于我来说……\n无论再怎么努力，也什么都……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef4831eb2d5f93e3979b2efe0ae83737ac0ca9efd16127711001eafc476d0cfb",
      "text": "……\n哭泣也是无济于事的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e3ec1ea776399480a2dab632481caa4f7f05d835f75952cda69605e838fc41e",
      "text": "必须用功才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9dab7ed2933dac0a8cb5077c47e6a0abeebdf8f51ec6f5666a302c1f0563ef",
      "text": "这次一定要好好证明，\n我是个“优秀的孩子”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44781ac3b87cb5e29fcc15fa1ed479915ef900f7c4a55f9b772e901861c15adf",
      "text": "百百人！全一模考的成绩，我们听说了哦。\n你这次又进了前5名吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edcd88fd41aed6355bd3c4541230a1d617a1329dcfafa2f3b43f03973587ccce",
      "text": "都说老天不会把好处全给一个人，\n但神明给百百人的才能也未免太多了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa31c435c0ed8cd70797f6ce486e3dba0570625531208fdfb6216f71ca107a71",
      "text": "毕竟你既会念书又擅长运动，\n甚至连艺术方面也样样精通啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11a1563c9598a078de37b6415bacde456fd616bc31392cd1f0039a151c748b52",
      "text": "（不是的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd3f64b013573c359a1a4054cae1689990445f66a5d9f2e7d656edf83cb91854",
      "text": "（这些全都不是什么才能）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0220f47e423ceac8870c0c9f8f20e1be0ecbe26c0cc9d6266fbb426b1ae282",
      "text": "（无论是学习、运动还是艺术……\n全都是我拼了命才掌握的啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fb3da45ddaa90aabc377a032f60a92fd140a8cdab7c1bf749b9a63399e5e4c7",
      "text": "（只不过是花了好多好多小时去学习、去练习而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b70cef74b29ecc9830cd933ea6d9c1d04a9201bfbfc1372b056c21f1342fe431",
      "text": "（真正的我，根本就没有任何一件\n能够做得很好的事情啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc4bac7e9487c1e388748fadc6d86fb7f339adb10a5d9669396e691ec9e4f78",
      "text": "？怎么了，百百人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38a3e6295599bf070aa3ad83274f817df9945b1b9b436b64b3a93bee0ff40b34",
      "text": "……没、没什么。\n谢谢大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9785524baf4967c24fc7d2cb6af3faeda6058ed0aa12b5cbd2b4d5bc93f97a",
      "text": "得赶快向爸爸和妈妈汇报才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fbc8816bf5305b69dcc353a2e5cc85dacb1274f422e13303f7f36560070cf39",
      "text": "这样啊……这次，果然也不是第一名呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a39397102c0c0f5240523609d7ad8c634606c0fa5ca1aae9c72eb67e6a136ac7",
      "text": "不过呢，妈妈多少早就料到了。\n正因为料到了，所以昨天呢，我和爸爸商量过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8d0b32937c8f6c2d4bb6764ed2a6330a5c51f276016a69e1bb130a854c524a1",
      "text": "虽然让你上了各种各样的兴趣班，\n但百百人似乎并没有任何才能呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab1ca9fad21af51826b8111589cc9dd2c014cbab8979eee357fefa0e108b91c",
      "text": "所以，我们决定不再为你花钱了。\n彼此互相苛求做不到的事，也只会痛苦而已，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:058a1cafdc62b6642fd04d3191cf79a9b7b9370ee7b260cc902c109897c780f9",
      "text": "今后，百百人随自己的心意去生活就好啦。\n虽然分别很令人遗憾，不过要好好保重哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcfda3cde9f82cee37466bd46f4e38ca943dc4864f9033e3418bd4671e923ff6",
      "text": "……嗯，我知道了。\n一直以来对不起，妈妈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34c8643b9ca963577d5897a0f348e24454a91d29b2f17a7675abea7cf222c472",
      "text": "（啊啊，果然我，\n不过是个残次品而已啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9c20296d3b3f8aa2f83d54197150835a50463c98310050e1931098c5f5651d",
      "text": "……第二天，我们一家三口聚在一起，\n吃了早饭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c731b1af5bfa66255300ef06841bf0f839dbbe0146db6c9f5400f8069d1f72",
      "text": "来，百百人！\n你从以前开始就很喜欢这个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41a4e0eca36bce6cc83ae059dac4db84a37445abfca166fb505c119aa4d0ad3",
      "text": "哦，今天早上全是百百人爱吃的大餐啊。\n怎么样，百百人。好吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545c21a23be4f8f16a0dc418ce8fc046a08c27f3131a1ffe2212d0f39d3c728a",
      "text": "哇……真的耶。\n谢谢妈妈。我开动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8f2838218d20a82853686a34ae9c8cccc72f4af4465a796de16823ce5715a65",
      "text": "……嗯，好好吃！\n妈妈做饭真厉害呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d14242859be4ac147aca6d3328c790c67adfd98e4a608c6d18936bd3705f328",
      "text": "我昨天特意为了百百人练习过了呢。\n做了好多，要多吃点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd4e23cffb2f3fd5bfc3e4118b6f0352587978a2922c094e895acf8e25215d23",
      "text": "两个人一边这么说着，一边把我不喜欢吃的东西摆上桌，\n笑得十分开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61278ad504b4e54f8f7d9566b7e05a1c400e40f3bb259bfaf55556a76a7a16bd",
      "text": "我虽然不知道有什么好笑的，\n但也一直在笑着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4c5ba46d946fe16191ad32670137c70fa557ad322d982bb766aa38d1a33b0b",
      "text": "我直到最后，都没能成为这个家的一员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef659d539e663b960a6ba86dcd343befa3213be38cfcea17a069c36200a691c6",
      "text": "……那天，等我放学回到家，\n妈妈已经离开了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1065158460543dc36477bb42ea76122726d327eaa56b4b171cb397f4d19ef0af",
      "text": "变得冷清的家里，\n只有爸爸偶尔会回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4390ec63ce6b0480c5dff1c48b07ca85491a6bf7871849df375ef1676ca5a745",
      "text": "自从那一天的早饭之后，\n我们之间就再也没有过像样的对话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:694496d5bb5072763f1125a2fa752060f3670b4925911d982f9291c22e23fb71",
      "text": "嗯……哈啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14023f3c971739226b3543b005186f5ceeb40cd02efeee562ed90d1950c41ffd",
      "text": "（最近，变得比以前更加不擅长早起了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3295662b6c83cc2df214892101e6ece62979c4eaabedcfb4ee50819363da10dd",
      "text": "（反正就算起来了，也什么都没有……\n只会去想那些令人郁闷的事而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d049ef375e5aa5f4dbdb3af39ddd04ac86af601d36a567badd89f6e2bbf2c9bc",
      "text": "早上好～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2a1f43cf3adb0df0d555d699d6a4265246c5911ec6142a8473eb442305985e7",
      "text": "花园～～……\n你小子，今天也是堂堂正正地迟到了啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad3346c55cbf8021ef38166eeda69dd6972439b86d75f283600425f6b787c50",
      "text": "对不起，老师。我早上起不来。\n不过，下次考试我也一定会全部科目都拿第一名的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44a586d8ac4abb9b31259f02c6c87e70b779bdf98c4169f9f98ca496ba0ac20c",
      "text": "唉，你这么一说我还怎么说你啊……\n对了！有东西要交给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b312dcd65c4f230ac03d685b790944df59a2f13faa484f1d557ba7598d1410",
      "text": "来，这是你前阵子获奖的绘画比赛奖杯！\n虽然我都不知道这是第几座了，但要好好珍惜啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96d1f44147b354c168dba5f523bbe1995a4b927f02e40bdb5d7149a61c371bfd",
      "text": "……哇，终于送到了啊。\n真高兴，得再去摆在房间里才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da",
      "text": "放学后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b8e8d3cce9f6922ca12bee763aa677e0f9ef7cee0e7d4c7d5355cb08f2520e3",
      "text": "这家伙是我的制作人。\n我们是来发掘你们两个人的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d34910ffd1f4c63f449e218c4d1f5efccea287179d3180e9f7a56fdc18f4dffe",
      "text": "（发掘……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4caabf3322a31f4af12076bba631dcaeb0d420d610400f4f03104c0ccc0f9d18",
      "text": "（……啊啊，又和这个奖杯一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d7bd7004135b9d165dcafe81d7c6546080f96ee722f54eb4b3dd5c6df0f923f",
      "text": "（只是增加一些派不上任何用场的称号而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e38c5667e1ed1a4b1d186094af1eff5f05ad557a645e94124468cd0407f021c",
      "text": "（而且……只是再一次次地证明，\n我是个多余的孩子而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5a3b0cdd59fe9ebefccab25f2315188e812828a0adb28ca382dd2fb37a939f1",
      "text": "……说是发掘，我挺开心的。\n不过，我可能没什么兴趣呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2650110c32e368579b2b33816202108333e2ca295dd73214824a48c04ae4f50b",
      "text": "拜托了。\n能否请您哪怕只是听我说一说呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df5af7a63075c56a87b0dcb2e64e87819b58fab712febba3e0f15055f7d2989",
      "text": "我在两位身上感受到了偶像的才能。\n请务必让我协助两位，将那份光芒传递给世界！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc1a0ccf30a607edb714e549190a7262568a809ffea3efd53d649b316db5d38b",
      "text": "（……有才能？我吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37bfc9aa55146a49904b22b3267dccf8b00ee101e37f6b8b227c715ba222f5f9",
      "text": "（你愿意给我，活下去的资格吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ada746bcf78f1ad52e2092ad2d0e311a1d97c220b3ebbb74bc640f4f2bce7f29",
      "text": "那么改天，请允许我在事务所为您说明详情。\n事务所的地点是…………？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f1b2e4b9900c01a6223bacc90d1d7c1d89be8d06c76e04844ca63886fc3047b",
      "text": "怎么了吗，百百人先生。\n一直这么盯着名片看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b88f19c572c1cf2d82a2b9317a261c32bbdbe1b21c79077487cc4398618e4cd2",
      "text": "你的名字……\n是叫●●●●プロデューサー啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7782b13e3e8321caa7d270f782ee98212fbfef40edfadec3a80548c9bfd38f52",
      "text": "是的！我从事偶像制作工作。\n再次向您致意，今后请多多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbea65fbf2526b7a12d69e29e9abed60d289566a00ff35a4d439bb86dbfbae47",
      "text": "嗯～……“制作人先生”啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86f1787673932178edcf02f5eb46a9ac94f4126948610149c07f8db581d346a3",
      "text": "我希望能换一个别的称呼呢……\n因为我想和你拉近关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff8595b8a88be2920ca820f9e163d2b34209236642ad0f737d0bd57230ca1fb8",
      "text": "我可以给你起个外号吗？\n短短的、叫起来顺口又可爱的比较好呢……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e2d662c613cdd6451ab56bf90d6cd3b1c9bdf0d8939440b10e3306d4f6963d",
      "text": "那就叫P酱。\n叫●●●●●●●●●●P酱吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a76098d7f8db493c3a872b198e4f82576fab59e3ebf0889f0b13359f1921b1",
      "text": "啊，那是指制作人的“P”吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b7f8444c7fc4a8873ebddb57d8f8f4fffa6b306da850951c146881422f080a",
      "text": "嗯。……难道说，\n已经有人用同样的称呼叫你了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b04d11b8e599eb6c5243ebc16ebd46387a4bd250be3f865b47331f50b1e095b1",
      "text": "没有，没有哦！只有百百人先生一个人这么叫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d38ca40292274c60d063047dbce2dd91d69af7670ee98feb30df89d08ef933f2",
      "text": "这样啊，那就太好了。\nP酱。今后请多关照咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8cc14cbe3803a7513a4e030b61c5e54ee6f16a0c0f4e66f3582d01720f12cf2",
      "text": "嘿嘿……拿到名片了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:593dfaea5198c2c1bf90c2f86c7300db9161d742ddd376d38d9e74fdf275cb11",
      "text": "315 Production的制作人……\nP酱，P酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e218a15736ff5494c263582e1f3d62404221400d58c293cfca45ff2bde6df73",
      "text": "……●●●●●●●●●●P酱说，\n感受到了我有做偶像的才能。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6efae10c28e92601ddadecd62555261521c5de2d2465c5b26fa389209bac23",
      "text": "（至今为止我挑战了各种各样的事，全都失败了。\n但是，我从来没有想过当偶像……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:996ae40be4676aa3753526c28d96b2e22ec76d215680dc767aee712dd1cdc628",
      "text": "（那一定，才是我的真正才能吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd4c327c48b986f22f3eef1c3503c8169f719bbe775d67b340551dc6d8a6eae",
      "text": "对了。把P酱的名片摆在房间里吧。\n放哪里好呢……嗯～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97124cd05ba723cd50e5a1e1ca60d3a9181932e54c851b96ff6f6ab499da3da8",
      "text": "……这里吧。\n嗯，放这里的话，随时都能看得到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c04542d85fee22a305fc35130a10997b25063fda517b7e755c200210236d9d0",
      "text": "P酱。只要是为了你，我什么都愿意做哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c9ff024de9e20080334ee433c58145f59c0abf4d230f623dd48e5daa4d398f",
      "text": "毕竟正如你所说的，花园百百人，\n是有着当偶像的才能的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
